# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# The workspace has ONE root pubspec.lock — committed for reproducible CI. (The
# root is not a published package; published members strip their lock on publish.
# Per-member lockfiles no longer exist under pub workspaces.)
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/build/
/coverage/
**/.cursor/
.gradle/

# Local audit / planning docs — kept untracked, never committed
/audit/
/REVIEW.md
/REFACTOR_PLAN.md
/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
